WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.803
Your phone holds your money, your messages and your memories.

2
00:00:05.603 --> 00:00:10.364
Most frauds don't hack your phone. They trick you into opening a door.

3
00:00:11.964 --> 00:00:18.220
The first door is your password. One password everywhere means one leak opens everything.

4
00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:24.155
Use a passphrase of four random words, different for every important account.

5
00:00:26.155 --> 00:00:31.332
The second door is a code. Someone says they sent you a code by mistake.

6
00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:38.079
That code opens your WhatsApp. Never share it, and switch on two-step verification.

7
00:00:40.079 --> 00:00:45.622
The third door is app permissions. Why would a simple torch app want your messages?

8
00:00:46.222 --> 00:00:48.846
Switch off whatever an app does not need.

9
00:00:51.246 --> 00:00:56.422
The fourth door: a screen lock and regular updates close the holes criminals already know.

10
00:00:58.422 --> 00:01:04.831
The fifth door is your ID. Lock your Aadhaar biometrics, and mark every photocopy.

11
00:01:08.031 --> 00:01:11.164
Five habits. Five locked doors.

12
00:01:13.164 --> 00:01:19.118
And if something does go wrong: stop, save the evidence, and call one nine three zero.
